  "design": "Original two-level ground-mounted peak-roof structure (1913); 75-ft X-brace steel tower by 1930, lowered to 20 ft in the late 1940s; 1951 35-ft H-brace steel tower with a cab (13x13 ft per FFLOS, 10-ft per FFLA-SDRC)",
  "height_m": 10.7,
